      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 6.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "Doctor, if you're free, we can start. I've got the numbers noted down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.18,
      "end_seconds": 12.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Welcome, tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.89,
      "end_seconds": 18.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling extremely weak, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.07,
      "end_seconds": 22.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.16,
      "end_seconds": 26.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Since last weekend, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.12,
      "end_seconds": 45.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.77,
      "end_seconds": 60.89,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "actually, you know, yes, erythromycin i've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.67,
      "end_seconds": 78.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.41,
      "end_seconds": 89.62,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol for about ten years now. I did try to ignore it for a while"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.07,
      "end_seconds": 93.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.22,
      "end_seconds": 96.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.66,
      "end_seconds": 101.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.79,
      "end_seconds": 106.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "I take rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.29,
      "end_seconds": 110.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.57,
      "end_seconds": 114.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.21,
      "end_seconds": 119.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.27,
      "end_seconds": 124.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.05,
      "end_seconds": 129.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.44,
      "end_seconds": 134.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "No, uh, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.07,
      "end_seconds": 138.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.48,
      "end_seconds": 141.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.49,
      "end_seconds": 145.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Alright, how's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.15,
      "end_seconds": 147.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 149.02,
      "end_seconds": 160.15,
      "duration_seconds": 11.13,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Oxygen saturation is 98 percent, temperature 36.4, respiratory rate 17, BP is 92 over 59, heart rate 108."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.95,
      "end_seconds": 163.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.83,
      "end_seconds": 168.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.41,
      "end_seconds": 179.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.42,
      "end_seconds": 184.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Okay, raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.2,
      "end_seconds": 206.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is very low and your skin is cool."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.84,
      "end_seconds": 212.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.29,
      "end_seconds": 265.61,
      "duration_seconds": 35.32,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, this is probably a possible adrenal crisis after stopping steroids. I want blood tests done, that's for adrenal crisis. The treatment will be hydrocortisone, 100 milligrams, once now, single dose. It's for adrenal crisis. I am giving an injection now and calling an ambulance. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I'm gonna send a referral to the emergency team."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.7,
      "end_seconds": 275.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. I'll want another look straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.73,
      "end_seconds": 279.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "I mean, okay, I'll arrange it it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.76,
      "end_seconds": 289.14,
      "duration_seconds": 8.38,
      "text": "Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.71,
      "end_seconds": 298.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "So, I take the hydrocortisone, 100 milligrams, once now and come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.91,
      "end_seconds": 305.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "yes, exactly right right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.74,
      "end_seconds": 311.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.74,
      "end_seconds": 313.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
